From a67e2e2fe25d67a3211d7cf7741da2cba5820b33 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Mon, 22 Jun 2026 01:25:56 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Redesign pages to match indigo design handoff

- Add .chip and .segmented components to index.css
- Rebuild Concerns: card list with CON-key, avatar initials, category chip,
  segmented status tabs, left accent border, Resolve action
- Rebuild Staff Requests: icon-tile cards, message bubble, segmented tabs,
  Approve/Reject buttons
- Rebuild Trash: subtitle, warning banner, icon tiles, restyled actions
- Rebuild Documents: folders grid, owner avatars, ext tiles, type badges
- Rebuild Daily Reports: summary tiles + report card list, submit moved to modal
- Assessments: add KPI tiles, subtitle header, segmented scope pills, token colors
- Remove all decorative emoji across pages (use lucide/design tokens per handoff)
- Carry over agent redesigns for Students, FollowUps, Tasks, Leads, StaffManagement

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01CiKwoJsWKnz4ZphCJJt1Eh
